   DisplaySET,#Sub10NumOfUnits=Total Number of Panels, Choose the number that you want to calculate from [Total Number of Units;Total Number of Cabinets/Closets;Total Number of Panels;Total Number of Wall Panels;Total Number of Base Panels;Total Number of Tall Panels;Total Number of Doors;Total Number of DrawerBoxes;Total Number of Pullouts]
   
   DisplaySET,#Sub10CostNumOfUnits=0 , Amount of number charge (amount to multiply for the above number)
   
   
   
   DisplaySET,#Sub10FlatCost=100,Amount of Flat Cost (A dollar amount to be added or subtracted)
   






